## Why website maintenance matters

An unmaintained website is a security risk. Outdated plugins and themes are the most common cause of hacked websites — and a hacked site can disappear from Google overnight, costing you rankings and customers you've worked hard to earn.

Our maintenance packages keep your site protected, performing, and always up to date — so you can focus on your business.

## What happens without maintenance

- Plugins and themes fall out of date, creating security vulnerabilities
- Your site slows down as software becomes inefficient
- Broken links and outdated content damage your [Google rankings](/services/local-seo-google-ranking/)
- If something breaks, you're on your own

With an NC Digital maintenance package, none of that is your problem.

## Built to work alongside your other services

Maintenance works best as part of a joined-up approach. If you don't already have a fast, reliable host, our [hosting and security package](/services/website-hosting-security/) pairs perfectly with maintenance. And if your site is outdated and due a refresh, our [web design service](/services/web-design/) can give you something worth maintaining.

